Description: fixtures to test a program that drives omx-clap-host
 Plugins and a signal source for testing a program that runs omx-clap-host as
 its CLAP worker: a plugin that reads the track information the host passes
 it, a compressor that reports meters, a gain that aborts on a write of 0.9
 or more, a JACK client that plays a constant level, and one that plays a
 noise into up to six effects and records each of them from the same cycles.
